       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n\nThis dose carries a serious risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- 400 mg by mouth four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- 800 mg by mouth three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg by mouth four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nTell me the intended dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that explicitly and give the clinical rationale. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy before I enter it."
